or Westlake Lessons, and has worked for the non-profits All Rhythms and Beyond The Grade teaching percussion and piano classes to underserved communities in the Austin area.",{"children":"Zach began working with students of all ages and abilities as soon as he returned to Austin from DePaul. He currently teaches piano lessons to students ages 6-12 for Westlake Lessons, and has worked for the non-profits All Rhythms and Beyond The Grade teaching percussion and piano classes to underserved communities in the Austin area."}],"$L4"]]}],"$L5"]}]]}],"$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb"]}],["$Lc"],"$Ld"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"ZmdOZvxDVpuPVNGIYaX7i"}
