12:["$","div",null,{"className":"appStoreSayHey glassCard","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"appStoreSayHeyLogo","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"appStoreSayHeyLogoWrap","children":["$","$L3",null,{"alt":"SayHey! app logo","fill":true,"sizes":"128px","src":"/assets/sayHeyLogo.png"}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"appStoreSayHeyCopy","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Translation & acquisition"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"SayHey!"}],[["$","p","SayHey! was a translation app built for travel’s return after COVID—when people were moving again but still wanted communication that felt human, not like a phrasebook. It centered expressive, personalized messaging across eighteen languages, with typography and color treated as part of what you were actually saying abroad.",{"children":"SayHey! was a translation app built for travel’s return after COVID—when people were moving again but still wanted communication that felt human, not like a phrasebook. It centered expressive, personalized messaging across eighteen languages, with typography and color treated as part of what you were actually saying abroad."}],["$","p","As the app found traction—including a strong run in Travel on the App Store—the naming rights and related IP were acquired, turning a lean, independently shipped product into a commercial asset with a clear ownership story.",{"children":"As the app found traction—including a strong run in Travel on the App Store—the naming rights and related IP were acquired, turning a lean, independently shipped product into a commercial asset with a clear ownership story."}],["$","p","Later, 7T acquired the company behind SayHey!. That transition led directly to joining 7T—carrying the same craft in React Native, product polish, and end-to-end delivery from SayHey! into broader mobile and platform work.",{"children":"Later, 7T acquired the company behind SayHey!. That transition led directly to joining 7T—carrying the same craft in React Native, product polish, and end-to-end delivery from SayHey! into broader mobile and platform work."}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"buttonRow","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"buttonGhost","href":"https://sayheyapp.link","rel":"noreferrer","target":"_blank","children":"SayHey! on the web"}],["$","a",null,{"className":"buttonGhost","href":"https://7t.ai","rel":"noreferrer","target":"_blank","children":"7T"}]]}]]}]]}]
